CareerSync Semantic Autofill V4 - Groq 413 / TPM fix

Fixes:
1. Groq request is compacted to stay below the 8k token/request budget.
2. Learned memory sent to AI reduced to latest 20 entries with short q/a only.
3. Resume context capped to 1800 characters for autofill semantic matching.
4. Empty profile values are removed before sending to AI.
5. Huge dropdowns no longer send hundreds of choices; likely profile/memory matches plus a small sample are sent.
6. AI prompt shortened while preserving semantic matching rules.
7. Extension sends up to 50 unresolved fields in one compact batch to avoid multiple requests consuming the per-minute token budget.
8. Existing V3 fixes remain, including clean select question text and duplicate-run protection.

Replace:
server/app/routers/extension.py
extension/background.js
extension/content/content.js

Then restart backend, reload extension, and refresh the form page.
